{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","瑟西娅"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名拥有控制能力的射手，可以召唤强大的仆从协同作战。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","你们还不配我起身"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","You're not even worth getting up for."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","始终高居上位，这就是贵族"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Being a noble is always being on top."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","出来吧，我的仆人（为我征战）"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Come out, my servant and fight for me!"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","归于死神的怀抱……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","Embraced... by the shadows... my journey... in flames..."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","呵，胜利理所应当"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","Well, victory is deserved."],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","赞美吧，你竟有机会觐见我"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","想拜见我？你要献上什么？"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","You desire an audience? And what do you offer?"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","（在手里把玩卡莱尔先生的棋子）仆从，还是掌握在手中比较好——（棋子落地，变成巨大仆从）——对吧？（一挥手，仆从消失）好了，去吧"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Ugh, how tedious."],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","真没意思。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","不错的品味，我开始欣赏你了。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","呵，能为我献上祭品，你应该感到荣幸。"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/cn","荆棘挽歌"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/cn","苦痛令乐声愈发悦耳，荆棘使冠冕更加高贵。"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/cn","星渊黯穹"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/cn","星辰坠入渊底，天穹化作幽暗。"],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/cn","外观商城购买可得该皮肤。"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/cn","史诗"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","不错的地方，对平民来说"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","勉强可以入眼吧"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","为我倒茶，仆人"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","真是优雅的雪景"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","享受这宁静的冬夜吧"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","有些过于喧嚷了"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","焰火还是远观最美"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","瑟西娅的仆人没有固定的名字，如何称呼他主要看瑟西娅当日的心情。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","据说，瑟西娅独处时偶尔会哼出一首曾经在耀光流行，现在却已无人知晓的曲调。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","“3日前，圣石镇毗邻的小镇上出现了一名疑似亡灵的女性。该女性于店铺橱窗外驻足片刻，并无异动，随后离开。”——出自“隐士”的报告。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","据一些亡灵猎人的小道消息说，瑟西娅的背后是班题斯帝国。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","瑟西娅常常毫无来由地发怒，还好她的仆人没有痛觉，不会为此吃苦头。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","据说，瑟西娅是某个渴望着生命力的亡灵组织的成员。耀光帝国的不少人对此相当留意。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","不知为什么，瑟西娅的仆人身上似乎有一些不知来历的绿裔气息。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","瑟西娅自诩贵族，但据斯莱泽评判，瑟西娅并没有贵族该有的矜持和优雅，瑟西娅固然有高高在上的态度，但那并不能证明她的身份。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","瑟西娅平等地看不起所有人，耀光人平平无奇，绿裔联盟的成员无聊透顶，蛮血氏族空有武力，就连永恒的亡灵眷族也有她可以非议之处。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","“背信弃义之人！”瑟西娅常收到这样的评价，她通常微笑着照单全收。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","真是个不错的地方，要是有清静些的包厢就更好了。"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415018.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","瑟西娅 & 斯莱泽"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","瑟西娅女士……\n您，想要一些花吗？"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415033.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","柳博米尔 & 瑟西娅"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","不错的地方，对平民来说"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415130.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","瑟西娅"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","为我倒茶，仆人"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415131.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","瑟西娅"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","真是优雅的雪景"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415441.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","瑟西娅"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","享受这宁静的冬夜吧"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415442.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","瑟西娅"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","有些过于喧嚷了"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415617.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","瑟西娅"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","焰火还是远观最美"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415618.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","瑟西娅"]]}